Output "/tmp/sshmgr-tutorial-frame.mp4"
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 640
Hide
Type "source ./.demo-env" Sleep 200ms Enter
Sleep 500ms
Type "clear" Sleep 200ms Enter
Sleep 500ms
Show
Type "./sshmgr version" Sleep 300ms Enter
Sleep 2s
Screenshot "../01-binary-version.png"
Sleep 500ms
